{"blocks":[{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" Department for Work and Pensions ","tree_line_end":6,"tree_line_start":2},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" DECISION MAKING AND APPEALS (PART OF STRATEGIC COMMUNICATIONS) ","tree_line_end":10,"tree_line_start":7},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":14,"tree_line_start":11},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Decision Makers Guide ","tree_line_end":18,"tree_line_start":15},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":21,"tree_line_start":19},{"depth":1,"role":"H2","text":"Volume 6 ","tree_line_end":25,"tree_line_start":22},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 50 – February 2018 ","tree_line_end":29,"tree_line_start":26},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":33,"tree_line_start":30},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":37,"tree_line_start":34},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"1. This letter provides details on Amendment 50; the changes have already been incorporated in to the Intranet and Internet versions of the DMG.  ","tree_line_end":43,"tree_line_start":38},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":48,"tree_line_start":44},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"2. PDF amendment packages are also available. These can be printed with the amended pages being reproduced in full. Each page will contain the amendment number in the footer  ","tree_line_end":54,"tree_line_start":49},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":59,"tree_line_start":55},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"PDF amendment packages can be found on the Intranet at: ","tree_line_end":64,"tree_line_start":60},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":69,"tree_line_start":65},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://intralink/1/lg/acileeds/guidance/decision%20makers%20guide/index.asp\n ","tree_line_end":81,"tree_line_start":70},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":86,"tree_line_start":82},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" or on the Internet at the ‘Amdt Packages’ tab on the following link: ","tree_line_end":90,"tree_line_start":87},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":94,"tree_line_start":91},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://www.dwp.gov.uk/publications/specialist-guides/decision-makers-guide/\n ","tree_line_end":106,"tree_line_start":95},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":111,"tree_line_start":107},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Note: When printing PDF packages set the print properties to Duplex/Long Edge in order to produce double sided prints. ","tree_line_end":116,"tree_line_start":112},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":121,"tree_line_start":117},{"depth":1,"role":"L","text":"3. Amendment 50 affects the abbreviations, chapters 30 and 34. The changes make amendments to: ","tree_line_end":128,"tree_line_start":122},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"3. Amendment 50 affects the abbreviations, chapters 30 and 34. The changes make amendments to: ","tree_line_end":128,"tree_line_start":123},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":132,"tree_line_start":129},{"depth":1,"role":"L","text":"• Chapter 30 - minor legal reference amendments to 30326 and 30682; re-drafting of 30285 and 30330.   \n• Chapter 34 incorporate the findings from the Reilly/Wilson Supreme Court case (i.e. the prior information requirement); inserts the new employment scheme Work & Health Programme and the findings of recent case law regarding good reason. ","tree_line_end":145,"tree_line_start":133},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• Chapter 30 - minor legal reference amendments to 30326 and 30682; re-drafting of 30285 and 30330.   ","tree_line_end":139,"tree_line_start":134},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• Chapter 34 incorporate the findings from the Reilly/Wilson Supreme Court case (i.e. the prior information requirement); inserts the new employment scheme Work & Health Programme and the findings of recent case law regarding good reason. ","tree_line_end":145,"tree_line_start":140},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":148,"tree_line_start":146},{"depth":